      "value": "Animus Dust"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This joyful, bouncing dust has been imbued with the very essence of life. \n\nSimply sprinkling it on basic "
        },
        {
          "text": "blocks will cause them to begin to move",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " and jump around for a short time before reverting back to their inanimate state. They even seem to "
        },
        {
          "text": "attack the monsters that come out in the night",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "! \n\nI wonder if I hang "
        },
        {
          "text": "Construct Parts",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " on an "
        },
        {
          "text": "Armor Stand",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " if it would "
        },
        {
          "text": "animate the construct",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "?  I bet it would."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
